1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,940
Walking the Camino

2
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:02,129
from Sarria?

3
00:00:02,129 --> 00:00:04,066
These are its 5 stages.

4
00:00:04,066 --> 00:00:05,719
Sarria to Portomarín:

5
00:00:05,719 --> 00:00:07,197
14 miles of villages

6
00:00:07,197 --> 00:00:08,713
and country lanes.

7
00:00:08,713 --> 00:00:10,534
Portomarín to Palas de Rei,

8
00:00:10,534 --> 00:00:11,591
with gentle climbs

9
00:00:11,591 --> 00:00:13,179
and small villages.

10
00:00:13,179 --> 00:00:14,640
Palas de Rei to Arzúa,

11
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:15,794
the longest.

12
00:00:15,794 --> 00:00:16,563
If you like,

13
00:00:16,563 --> 00:00:17,536
split it with a night

14
00:00:17,536 --> 00:00:18,619
in Melide.

15
00:00:18,619 --> 00:00:19,984
Arzúa to A Rúa,

16
00:00:19,984 --> 00:00:21,740
through woods and hamlets.

17
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:23,477
And A Rúa to Santiago,

18
00:00:23,477 --> 00:00:23,945
all the way

19
00:00:23,945 --> 00:00:25,329
to the Cathedral.

20
00:00:25,329 --> 00:00:26,693
69 miles and

21
00:00:26,693 --> 00:00:28,075
your Compostela.

22
00:00:28,075 --> 00:00:29,880
Save this for your Camino.
